  "description": "Da-Gyeong and Seong-Jae were inseparable as kids. But as they grew up, Seong-Jae became a delinquent and a notorious playboy, or so Da-Gyeong thought. But when the topic of an arranged marriage comes up between the two, Seong-Jae admits he's still a virgin and has been saving himself for his childhood sweetheart. Is he telling the truth, or is this just another scheme in his womanizing playbook?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Dongjeongnam Danpyeonseon (동정남 단편선) Collection.*",
